We have a Drillster app update for you. It contains a brand-new drill player, which is now active by default. The biggest improvement of the new player is the way feedback is displayed. Feedback directly after every exercise is important for the learning effect. Therefore, it now has a (much) more prominent role. Regardless of your answer, the feedback section will tell you what was the right answer and why, so you learn from each exercise at that very moment. The app will now also tell you how long it will take you to reach 100% proficiency. Moreover, to make all of our lives better, we improved the way visuals, like videos and images, are shown. You can use visuals in questions, answers, and feedback. 
We doubt you’ll want to, but it’s possible to switch back to the previous player by going to settings and toggling ‘Built-in player’. Do tell us your reasons and give us your feedback (support@drillster.com), so we can improve. Thanks!

WHAT'S NEW?
The new default drill player means the following:
- Higher performance
- We improved the overall look & feel of the app;
- It’s also more intuitive;
- More gamification elements;
- Better didactics;
- More focus on the right answer after each exercise. Regardless of your answer: we focus on what was the right answer and why;
- Feedback is better and more pedagogical displayed;
- Visuals, like videos and images, are shown bigger and better to learners;
- Last but not least: the learning curve graph has a more prominent role in the app. It will also tell you how long it will take you to reach 100% proficiency.

To switch back to the previous player, go to settings and toggle ‘built-in player’.

ABOUT DRILLSTER
Drillster is a smart learning application that ensures that critical knowledge and competencies stay top of mind continuously, so employees can perform with the right knowledge at the right time. Its unique methodology combines adaptivity, microlearning, assessment-based learning, and instant feedback into one simple tool. Creating and adjusting content is easy and the smart algorithm automatically adapts learning content to the individual learning curve and forgetting curve. Effective and efficient, for both learning professionals and learners.

Happy learning!

FEEDBACK
At Drillster we are ‘Learning with you’, so we’d love your feedback. If you have questions, or suggestions for improvement, don't hesitate to email support@drillster.com or give us a call at +31883750500. Are you a Drillster fan already and have a minute to spare? Leave a review. Thank you in advance!

Creative and educational game for children that will help your child spend time with an electronic device effectively. Let your child feel like a real artist. The app includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest as well as drawing lessons intended to develop fine motor skills. Also, the app contains pictures on different topics which will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 135 pages;
- Easy coloring for children;
- Drawing lessons;
- Creativity development.

The app is designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as developing of fine motor skills and logic. Have fun!

Educational games for children which will help your baby spend his time with an electronic device effectively. You will visit Bimi Boo’s friends who live on a wondrous island. You will play developing games with a kittens, funny birds and cute squirrel.

The application includes simple games intended to develop fine motor skills and that will entertain your child with bright colors, nice characters and interesting tasks:

- Arrange object by color, form, number and size;
- Use logic when selecting series of items;
- Put geometrical figures on the silhouette;
- Sort things in the right order;
- Restore pictures from memory.

Designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 5 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as puzzles, sorting and logical games.

The application contains the following developing and educative games for children:

- Items sorting – you need to put food into the fridge and clothes into the wardrobe;
- Logic tasks in the game with a train – help cute kittens get home and deliver food for them;
- Thinking activities where your kid will arrange items in the baskets;
- Logical thinking tasks where your child will sort things by their features.

